id: og_sorting_c
name: Sorting Hall III
description: Sorting Hall. One enormous sorting floor with a mezzanine running right round the inside of it, so everything above can see everything below and neither can reach the other quickly. Built as a parcel sorting hall; the belts stopped with the night shift still loaded and nobody cleared them.

